name: shell_importers
description: "Shell importers - addresses that host many companies, with those companies' directors, payments out and the trades shipped to them. Look for newly incorporated importers at one formation-agent address, run by two directors, that pay one exporter far more than it ever shipped them (compare paid with traded_with). Long-standing companies at a large business centre, each with its own directors and its own trading partners, are ordinary."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: force
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: trade_shell_importers_links_dataset
    sourceCol: src
    targetCol: dst
    linkKindCol: kind
    attrCols[4]: ts,amount,via,flag
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    hulls: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
